# Bot1 takes Bot2's Elvish Mystic with Control Magic, then puts its own Creature Bond on it and destroys it with Infernal
# Grasp. The Aura deals 1 damage (the Mystic's toughness) to the creature's controller as it last existed on the
# battlefield (CR 608.2h), Bot1 - not to its owner, Bot2, into whose graveyard it goes: Bot1 loses 2 to Grasp and 1 to the
# Aura, Bot2 stays at 20.

